  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup chia seeds (ground)",
    "2 tablespoon psyllium husk powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon xanthan gum",
    "1/4 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon onion powder",
    "1/4 teaspoon dried oregano",
    "1/4 teaspoon paprika",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "1/4 teaspoon black pepper",
    "2 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 1/4 cup ice water",
    "3 ounce cheddar cheese (grated)"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 375F. Using a spice grinder, process the chia seeds into a mealy texture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0487.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the processed chia seeds to a bowl with psyllium husk powder, xanthan gum, garlic powder, onion powder, oregano, paprika, salt, and pepper. Mix well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0491.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the olive oil to the dry ingredients and mix until the mixture takes on the consistency of wet sand.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0502.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add some ice-cold water to the bowl and mix very well. This may take some extra time, as the chia seeds and psyllium husks take a while to absorb the water. Keep mixing until a firm dough is formed.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0507.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Grate the cheddar cheese and add it to the bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0511.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Knead the dough until relatively dry and no longer sticky.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0518.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the dough on a Silpat and let sit for a few minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0525.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread or roll the dough out thinly, so that it covers the entire Silpat. If it can be made thinner, keep rolling and save the excess dough for a second batch.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0536.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake for 30–35 minutes. Remove from the oven and cut into individual crackers while still hot using a spatula or other blunt edge (so as not to damage the silicone).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0548.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slightly spread the crackers, so they are no longer touching. Turn oven to broil.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Broil the cut crackers in the oven for 5–7 minutes, or until the tops are browned and crisp. Remove from the oven and set on a rack to cool and crisp up even more.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/08/img_0561.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/low-carb-chia-seed-crackers/#wprm-recipe-51265-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
